    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1150">

                <pb facs="1256" n="1244" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg1244"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Italy)/2–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-02-17T16:00:00-04:00">February 17,
                            1945—4 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>331. Department appreciates information contained in your 388 February 13 and
                    your analysis of financial proposals. Your comments appear to us to deserve
                    fundamental review of our financial proposals. Would you object to our giving
                    this telegram to Treasury, and possibly War, for limited distribution for
                    purposes of such discussion?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
